bad5","label":"正文","text":"朱异夜渡筑垒后为石苞州泰击破","evidence":["santizhu064-q-216d48cb470c163c85cd"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0126","role":"遣部将夜渡筑垒，遭击破后退至高处并复作围","evidence":["santizhu064-q-216d48cb470c163c85cd"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0161","role":"奉命募勇士夜渡","evidence":["santizhu064-q-216d48cb470c163c85cd"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0162","role":"奉命募勇士夜渡","evidence":["santizhu064-q-216d48cb470c163c85cd"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0138","role":"与州泰击破朱异所部","evidence":["santizhu064-q-216d48cb470c163c85cd"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0035","role":"与石苞击破朱异所部","evidence":["santizhu064-q-216d48cb470c163c85cd"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-216d48cb470c163c85cd"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-216d48cb470c163c85cd","source_order":[64,90,44],"order":11017}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0035","name":"州泰","evidence":["shaodi-q-o048","wgc-q0028","wgc-q0062","wgc-q0126","wgc-q0029","santizhu064-q-c5c21d18f99d98eafb88","santizhu064-q-216d48cb470c163c85cd","xuhuwang-q-31aed6ec65e1285c8549","xuhuwang-q-d5429e748b6b56be9570","xuhuwang-q-5aa3589fbf970a3d1a71"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o048-shaodi-p0035","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o048"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o035-shaodi-p0035","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及州泰","evidence":["wgc-q0028"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o080-shaodi-p0035","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及州泰","evidence":["wgc-q0062"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p045-shaodi-p0035","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及州泰","evidence":["wgc-q0126"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o036-shaodi-p0035","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及州泰","evidence":["wgc-q0029"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-216d48cb470c163c85cd","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-f1f75337999ea6de2e8a","layer":"original","quote":"异屯黎浆〖6〗，遣将军任度、张震等募勇敢六千人，于屯西六里为浮桥夜渡〖7〗，筑偃月垒〖8〗。为魏监军石苞及州泰所破，军却退就高。异复作车箱围，趋五木城","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":440,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":44,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-c5c21d18f99d98eafb88","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-390d7a804c8a1bdac217","layer":"original","quote":"魏悉中外军二十余万，增诞之围。朱异帅三万人屯安城〖2〗，为文钦势。魏兖州刺史州泰拒异于阳渊〖3〗，异败退；为泰所追，死伤二千人","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":439,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":59,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o047d-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-3b3163edc9e235a7bd49","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，以特进孙资为骠骑将军。十一月，司空孙礼薨。十二月，甲辰〖15〗，东海王霖薨。乙未〖16〗，征南将军王昶渡江〖17〗，掩攻吴，破之。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o048a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-214613f5a625f33a352f","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，荆州刺史王基、新城太守（陈）〔州〕泰攻吴〖2〗。破之，降者数千口。二月，置南郡之夷陵县以居降附〖3〗。三月，以尚书令司马孚为司空〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-068bc9d40974f88b77f9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：嘉平三年（公元 251）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-563b7a630850bbcc0541","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o048","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-214613f5a625f33a352f","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，荆州刺史王基、新城太守（陈）〔州〕泰攻吴〖2〗。破之，降者数千口。二月，置南郡之夷陵县以居降附〖3〗。三月，以尚书令司马孚为司空〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0028","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-c135ec113c597ad4f2da","layer":"original","quote":"六月，车驾东征，至项。大将军司马文王督中外诸军二十六万众，临淮讨之。大将军屯丘头，使基及安东将军陈骞等四面合围，表里再重〖9〗，堑垒甚峻。又使监军石苞、兖州刺史州泰等〖10〗，简锐卒为游军〖11〗，备外寇。钦等数出犯围〖12〗，逆击走之。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":175,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0029","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-415a96152140983fb9ca","layer":"original","quote":"吴将朱异再以大众来迎诞等，渡黎浆水〖1〗；泰等逆与战，每摧其锋。孙綝以异战不进〖2〗，怒而杀之。城中食转少，外救不至，众无所恃。将军蒋班、焦彝，皆诞爪牙计事者也；弃诞，逾城自归大将军〖3〗。﹝一﹞大将军乃使反间，以奇变说全怿等〖4〗；怿等率众数千人，开门来出。城中震惧，不知所为。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":140,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0062","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-4b76484f529dd4ff15bc","layer":"original","quote":"艾州里时辈南阳州泰〖24〗，亦好立功业；善用兵，官至征虏将军，假节，都督江南诸军事〖25〗。景元二年薨，追赠卫将军，谥曰壮侯。﹝二﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":406,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0126","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7c4cb6e3288767c0659f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《世语》曰：“初，荆州刺史裴潜以泰为从事。司马宣王镇宛，潜数遣诣宣王，由此为宣王所知。及征孟达，泰又导军，遂辟泰。泰频丧考、妣、祖，九年居丧；宣王留缺待之。至，三十六日，擢为新城太守。宣王为泰会，使尚书钟（繇）〔毓〕调泰：‘君释褐登宰府，三十六日拥麾盖，守兵马郡；乞儿乘小车，一何驶乎？’泰曰：‘诚有此！君，名公之子，少有文采，故守吏职；猕猴骑上牛，又何迟也！’众宾咸悦。后历兖、豫州刺史，所在有筹算绩效。”","attribution":"世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":435,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-83035962258f184f04f4","start":0,"end":207,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0282","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-c135ec113c597ad4f2da","layer":"original","quote":"又使监军石苞、兖州刺史州泰等〖10〗，简锐卒为游军〖11〗，备外寇","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":175,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":69,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0284","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-415a96152140983fb9ca","layer":"original","quote":"吴将朱异再以大众来迎诞等，渡黎浆水〖1〗；泰等逆与战，每摧其锋","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0415","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-4b76484f529dd4ff15bc","layer":"original","quote":"官至征虏将军，假节，都督江南诸军事","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":406,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0416","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-4b76484f529dd4ff15bc","layer":"original","quote":"景元二年薨，追赠卫将军，谥曰壮侯","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":406,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0610","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7c4cb6e3288767c0659f","layer":"pei","quote":"初，荆州刺史裴潜以泰为从事。司马宣王镇宛，潜数遣诣宣王，由此为宣王所知","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":435,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-83035962258f184f04f4","start":10,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0611","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7c4cb6e3288767c0659f","layer":"pei","quote":"及征孟达，泰又导军，遂辟泰","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":435,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-83035962258f184f04f4","start":46,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0612","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7c4cb6e3288767c0659f","layer":"pei","quote":"泰频丧考、妣、祖，九年居丧；宣王留缺待之。至，三十六日，擢为新城太守","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":435,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-83035962258f184f04f4","start":60,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0613","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7c4cb6e3288767c0659f","layer":"pei","quote":"宣王为泰会，使尚书钟（繇）〔毓〕调泰：‘君释褐登宰府，三十六日拥麾盖，守兵马郡；乞儿乘小车，一何驶乎？’泰曰：‘诚有此！君，名公之子，少有文采，故守吏职；猕猴骑上牛，又何迟也！’众宾咸悦","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":435,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-83035962258f184f04f4","start":95,"end":188,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0687","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7c4cb6e3288767c0659f","layer":"pei","quote":"后历兖、豫州刺史，所在有筹算绩效。","attribution":"世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":435,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-83035962258f184f04f4","start":189,"end":206,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-31aed6ec65e1285c8549","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-d91e3ae6a09aaa15b47e","layer":"original","quote":"二年〖22〗，昶奏：“孙权流放良臣〖23〗，嫡庶分争〖24〗；可乘衅而制吴、蜀。白帝、夷陵之间〖25〗，黔、巫、秭归、房陵皆在江北〖26〗；民、夷与新城郡接〖27〗：可袭取也。”","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":207,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-4eae72fe193408cf4256","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-740080942f6b034a42cd","layer":"original","quote":"随征南王昶击吴〖10〗；基别袭步协于夷陵〖11〗。协闭门自守。基示以攻形，而实分兵取雄父邸阁〖12〗，收米三十余万斛；虏安北将军谭正，纳降数千口。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":285,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-5aa3589fbf970a3d1a71","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-9aa66ef038f5e52e2dec","layer":"original","quote":"昶欲引致平地与合战，乃先遣五军案大道发还〖32〗，使贼望见以喜之；以所获铠马甲首〖33〗，驰环城以怒之；设伏兵以待之。绩果追军；与战，克之，绩遁走，斩其将钟离茂、许旻，收其甲首旗鼓珍宝器仗，振旅而还。王基、州泰皆有功。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":209,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-d5429e748b6b56be9570","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-2eee00b1e96c9cb1b922","layer":"original","quote":"乃遣新城太守州泰袭巫、秭归、房陵〖28〗，荆州刺史王基诣夷陵；昶诣江陵，两岸引竹f为桥〖29〗，渡水击之〖30〗。贼奔南岸，凿七道并来攻。于是昶使积弩同时俱发，贼大将施绩夜遁入江陵城〖31〗，追斩数百级。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
